  "description": "Fuaran.Program.Runtime — the client placement of the bounded program loop: run a wire-decoded program tree interactively in the browser with no hand-authored update function, no message type and no server. Shares the interpreter with the server placement rather than reimplementing it, so the same tree behaves identically at both. Renderer, effect performer, op sink and live channel are injected seams. Apache-2.0 licensed.",
